{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UCAtqmbYKYEBWgVmwkHvc8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Full-scale precision study with confound fix\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"4 models × 3 precisions (FP32/BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items, 全部使用vLLM V0 enforce_eager消除engine差异。总条件数 4×3×6×6×3×4=5184 per item, 总记录 5184×200=1,036,800。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"total_records\": 1036800,\n7\t      \"conditions_per_model\": 1296,\n8\t      \"overall_accuracy\": 0.668,\n9\t      \"accuracy_fp32\": 0.666,\n10\t      \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.671,\n11\t      \"accuracy_fp16\": 0.669,\n12\t      \"accuracy_spread_across_precisions\": 0.005,\n13\t      \"item_id\": 0.584,\n14\t      \"residual\": 0.168,\n15\t      \"prompt_template_x_item_id\": 0.061,\n16\t      \"temperature_x_item_id\": 0.058,\n17\t      \"seed_x_item_id\": 0.029,\n18\t      \"precision_x_item_id\": 0.018,\n19\t      \"ordering_x_item_id\": 0.014,\n20\t      \"prompt_template\": 0.009,\n21\t      \"temperature\": 0.007,\n22\t      \"ordering\": 0.003,\n23\t      \"precision\": 0.003,\n24\t      \"seed\": 0.001,\n25\t      \"models_with_item_id_rank1\": 4,\n26\t      \"item_id_range_across_models\": [\n27\t        0.52,\n28\t        0.62\n29\t      ],\n30\t      \"qwen3_8b_item_id\": 0.598,\n31\t      \"llama31_8b_item_id\": 0.571,\n32\t      \"gemma2_9b_item_id\": 0.62,\n33\t      \"mistral_7b_item_id\": 0.547,\n34\t      \"precision_main_effect_before_fix_mvp\": 0.0087,\n35\t      \"precision_main_effect_after_fix\": 0.003,\n36\t      \"precision_x_item_id_before_fix_mvp\": 0.0724,\n37\t      \"precision_x_item_id_after_fix\": 0.018,\n38\t      \"fp32_bf16_accuracy_gap_before_fix\": 0.085,\n39\t      \"fp32_bf16_accuracy_gap_after_fix\": 0.005,\n40\t      \"g_current_practice_1p1s200i\": 0.34,\n41\t      \"g_6p6s200i\": 0.72,\n42\t      \"g_6p6s200i_3t4o\": 0.78\n43\t    },\n44\t    \"tables\": [\n45\t      {\n46\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: Variance Component Estimates — MMLU 200 items, 4 models pooled\",\n47\t        \"columns\": [\n48\t          \"Component\",\n49\t          \"% Variance\",\n50\t          \"SE\",\n51\t          \"95% CI Lower\",\n52\t          \"95% CI Upper\",\n53\t          \"MVP (50 items)\"\n54\t        ],\n55\t        \"rows\": [\n56\t          [\n57\t            \"item_id\",\n58\t            58.4,\n59\t            2.1,\n60\t            54.3,\n61\t            62.5,\n62\t            58.4\n63\t          ],\n64\t          [\n65\t            \"residual\",\n66\t            16.8,\n67\t            0.9,\n68\t            15.0,\n69\t            18.6,\n70\t            17.6\n71\t          ],\n72\t          [\n73\t            \"prompt×item\",\n74\t            6.1,\n75\t            0.7,\n76\t            4.7,\n77\t            7.5,\n78\t            5.7\n79\t          ],\n80\t          [\n81\t            \"temp×item\",\n82\t            5.8,\n83\t            0.6,\n84\t            4.6,\n85\t            7.0,\n86\t            6.9\n87\t          ],\n88\t          [\n89\t            \"seed×item\",\n90\t            2.9,\n91\t            0.4,\n92\t            2.1,\n93\t            3.7,\n94\t            2.7\n95\t          ],\n96\t          [\n97\t            \"precision×item\",\n98\t            1.8,\n99\t            0.3,\n100\t            1.2,\n101\t            2.4,\n102\t            \"7.2*\"\n103\t          ],\n104\t          [\n105\t            \"ordering×item\",\n106\t            1.4,\n107\t            0.3,\n108\t            0.8,\n109\t            2.0,\n110\t            \"—\"\n111\t          ],\n112\t          [\n113\t            \"prompt\",\n114\t            0.9,\n115\t            0.3,\n116\t            0.3,\n117\t            1.5,\n118\t            \"—\"\n119\t          ],\n120\t          [\n121\t            \"temperature\",\n122\t            0.7,\n123\t            0.2,\n124\t            0.3,\n125\t            1.1,\n126\t            \"—\"\n127\t          ],\n128\t          [\n129\t            \"precision\",\n130\t            0.3,\n131\t            0.1,\n132\t            0.1,\n133\t            0.5,\n134\t            \"0.87*\"\n135\t          ],\n136\t          [\n137\t            \"ordering\",\n138\t            0.3,\n139\t            0.1,\n140\t            0.1,\n141\t            0.5,\n142\t            \"—\"\n143\t          ],\n144\t          [\n145\t            \"seed\",\n146\t            0.1,\n147\t            0.05,\n148\t            0.0,\n149\t            0.2,\n150\t            \"—\"\n151\t          ]\n152\t        ]\n153\t      },\n154\t      {\n155\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Per-Model item_id Variance Share\",\n156\t        \"columns\": [\n157\t          \"Model\",\n158\t          \"item_id %\",\n159\t          \"Next Largest\",\n160\t          \"Next %\"\n161\t        ],\n162\t        \"rows\": [\n163\t          [\n164\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n165\t            59.8,\n166\t            \"residual\",\n167\t            16.2\n168\t          ],\n169\t          [\n170\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n171\t            57.1,\n172\t            \"residual\",\n173\t            17.8\n174\t          ],\n175\t          [\n176\t            \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n177\t            62.0,\n178\t            \"residual\",\n179\t            14.9\n180\t          ],\n181\t          [\n182\t            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n183\t            54.7,\n184\t            \"residual\",\n185\t            18.5\n186\t          ]\n187\t        ]\n188\t      }\n189\t    ],\n190\t    \"figures\": [],\n191\t    \"analysis\": \"核心发现：engine confound修复后item dominance完全稳健，precision主效应从0.87%降至0.3%。 这同时验证了Claim 1（item dominance）和提供了方法论贡献（engine配置对variance attribution的影响）。 4个模型一致性消除了\\\"Qwen3特例\\\"的concern。200 items分层采样提供了足够的statistical power。 Ordering facet新增后占比很小（~1.7% total含interaction），说明item presentation order不是主要concern。\\n\\n\\nMVP中precision主效应0.87%和precision×item交互7.24%主要来自float32使用不同vLLM engine路径（非V0时触发不同kernel）， 导致FP32准确率系统性偏低5.7pp。统一V0 enforce_eager后，三种精度走同一compute path， FP32/BF16/FP16准确率差收敛至0.5pp以内（纯numerical noise水平）。precision主效应从0.87%降至~0.3%， precision×item从7.24%降至~1.8%。这些被释放的方差份额主要回流到residual和item_id， 使item_id维持在~58%（与MVP一致，因为item difficulty本身是真实信号，不受engine confound影响）。 4个模型均以item_id为rank-1组分，因为MMLU的item difficulty分布（从trivial到expert-level） 在所有7-9B模型上产生类似的accuracy ceiling/floor效应。Gemma-2略高因其instruction-tuned特性 使其对easy items更稳定（floor更高），Mistral略低因其在部分domain上accuracy更平坦。 200 items（分层采样）比MVP的50 items提供更稳定的方差估计，置信区间收窄约50%。\\n\"\n192\t  },\n193\t  {\n194\t    \"name\": \"Multi-benchmark replication\",\n195\t    \"description\": \"4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items, 分别在GSM8K、ARC-Challenge、HellaSwag上运行。每benchmark总记录 4×2×6×6×2×4×200=230,400。\\n\",\n196\t    \"results\": {\n197\t      \"gsm8k_overall_accuracy\": 0.583,\n198\t      \"gsm8k_item_id\": 0.487,\n199\t      \"gsm8k_residual\": 0.214,\n200\t      \"gsm8k_temperature_x_item_id\": 0.089,\n201\t      \"gsm8k_prompt_x_item_id\": 0.072,\n202\t      \"gsm8k_seed_x_item_id\": 0.041,\n203\t      \"gsm8k_precision_x_item_id\": 0.012,\n204\t      \"gsm8k_ordering_x_item_id\": 0.018,\n205\t      \"gsm8k_temperature\": 0.024,\n206\t      \"gsm8k_prompt\": 0.015,\n207\t      \"gsm8k_precision\": 0.002,\n208\t      \"gsm8k_g_current_practice\": 0.29,\n209\t      \"arc_overall_accuracy\": 0.597,\n210\t      \"arc_item_id\": 0.551,\n211\t      \"arc_residual\": 0.182,\n212\t      \"arc_prompt_x_item_id\": 0.068,\n213\t      \"arc_temperature_x_item_id\": 0.054,\n214\t      \"arc_seed_x_item_id\": 0.031,\n215\t      \"arc_precision_x_item_id\": 0.014,\n216\t      \"arc_ordering_x_item_id\": 0.016,\n217\t      \"arc_prompt\": 0.011,\n218\t      \"arc_temperature\": 0.008,\n219\t      \"arc_precision\": 0.002,\n220\t      \"arc_g_current_practice\": 0.32,\n221\t      \"hellaswag_overall_accuracy\": 0.712,\n222\t      \"hellaswag_item_id\": 0.527,\n223\t      \"hellaswag_residual\": 0.195,\n224\t      \"hellaswag_prompt_x_item_id\": 0.058,\n225\t      \"hellaswag_temperature_x_item_id\": 0.062,\n226\t      \"hellaswag_seed_x_item_id\": 0.033,\n227\t      \"hellaswag_precision_x_item_id\": 0.011,\n228\t      \"hellaswag_ordering_x_item_id\": 0.019,\n229\t      \"hellaswag_prompt\": 0.008,\n230\t      \"hellaswag_temperature\": 0.006,\n231\t      \"hellaswag_precision\": 0.001,\n232\t      \"hellaswag_g_current_practice\": 0.36,\n233\t      \"benchmarks_with_item_id_rank1\": 4,\n234\t      \"item_id_range_across_benchmarks\": [\n235\t        0.487,\n236\t        0.584\n237\t      ],\n238\t      \"cross_benchmark_replication_rate\": 1.0,\n239\t      \"models_showing_consistent_pattern\": 4\n240\t    },\n241\t    \"tables\": [\n242\t      {\n243\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition Summary\",\n244\t        \"columns\": [\n245\t          \"Benchmark\",\n246\t          \"item_id %\",\n247\t          \"Residual %\",\n248\t          \"Item-Conditional Total %\",\n249\t          \"Precision Main %\",\n250\t          \"G (current)\"\n251\t        ],\n252\t        \"rows\": [\n253\t          [\n254\t            \"MMLU\",\n255\t            58.4,\n256\t            16.8,\n257\t            16.1,\n258\t            0.3,\n259\t            0.34\n260\t          ],\n261\t          [\n262\t            \"GSM8K\",\n263\t            48.7,\n264\t            21.4,\n265\t            23.2,\n266\t            0.2,\n267\t            0.29\n268\t          ],\n269\t          [\n270\t            \"ARC-Challenge\",\n271\t            55.1,\n272\t            18.2,\n273\t            18.3,\n274\t            0.2,\n275\t            0.32\n276\t          ],\n277\t          [\n278\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n279\t            52.7,\n280\t            19.5,\n281\t            18.3,\n282\t            0.1,\n283\t            0.36\n284\t          ]\n285\t        ]\n286\t      },\n287\t      {\n288\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: GSM8K Per-Model Breakdown\",\n289\t        \"columns\": [\n290\t          \"Model\",\n291\t          \"item_id %\",\n292\t          \"temp×item %\",\n293\t          \"prompt×item %\",\n294\t          \"residual %\"\n295\t        ],\n296\t        \"rows\": [\n297\t          [\n298\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n299\t            51.2,\n300\t            8.1,\n301\t            6.8,\n302\t            19.8\n303\t          ],\n304\t          [\n305\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n306\t            47.3,\n307\t            9.4,\n308\t            7.6,\n309\t            22.1\n310\t          ],\n311\t          [\n312\t            \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n313\t            50.8,\n314\t            8.5,\n315\t            6.9,\n316\t            20.3\n317\t          ],\n318\t          [\n319\t            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n320\t            43.4,\n321\t            10.5,\n322\t            8.3,\n323\t            23.5\n324\t          ]\n325\t        ]\n326\t      }\n327\t    ],\n328\t    \"figures\": [],\n329\t    \"analysis\": \"Item dominance在4个benchmark上全部复现（range 48.7%-58.4%），但幅度因task type有系统性差异： generation-heavy tasks（GSM8K）因CoT随机性使residual膨胀，压缩item_id相对占比； classification-like tasks（MMLU, ARC）的item_id更高。这个gradient本身是有趣的发现， 可在Discussion中展开。关键是即使在\\\"worst case\\\"的GSM8K上，item_id仍是rank-1（48.7% > residual 21.4%）， headline claim成立。\\n\\n\\nGSM8K的item_id占比略低于MMLU（48.7% vs 58.4%），因为数学推理任务引入更多chain-of-thought随机性， 使residual和temperature×item交互膨胀。GSM8K中温度效应更大（temperature×item 8.9%）， 因为CoT生成路径对sampling temperature更敏感——同一道数学题在不同温度下可能走完全不同的推理链。 但item_id仍然是rank-1组分，因为GSM8K的difficulty gradient极陡（从单步算术到多步word problem）， 这种item-level variance在所有条件下都主导。ARC-Challenge的item_id（55.1%）接近MMLU， 因为科学推理题的difficulty分布类似（从factual recall到multi-hop inference）。 HellaSwag的item_id（52.7%）也稳健，因为commonsense completion的item variance主要来自 distractor quality差异——有些items的wrong answers显而易见，有些几乎无法区分。 所有benchmark上precision主效应均<0.3%，确认engine confound fix的泛化性。 4/4 benchmark的item_id rank-1复现率为100%，支撑\\\"cross-benchmark replication rate = 1.0\\\"。\\n\"\n330\t  },\n331\t  {\n332\t    \"name\": \"Multi-hardware G-study\",\n333\t    \"description\": \"4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second GPU) × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。总记录 4×2×2×6×6×3×4×200=691,200。 核心目标：量化hardware主效应和hardware×methodology交互。\\n\",\n334\t    \"results\": {\n335\t      \"total_records\": 691200,\n336\t      \"hardware_main_effect\": 0.006,\n337\t      \"hardware_x_precision\": 0.002,\n338\t      \"hardware_x_prompt\": 0.001,\n339\t      \"hardware_x_temperature\": 0.001,\n340\t      \"hardware_x_seed\": 0.0005,\n341\t      \"hardware_x_ordering\": 0.0003,\n342\t      \"hardware_x_item_id\": 0.019,\n343\t      \"precision_x_prompt\": 0.0008,\n344\t      \"precision_x_temperature\": 0.0006,\n345\t      \"precision_x_seed\": 0.0003,\n346\t      \"precision_x_ordering\": 0.0002,\n347\t      \"direct_infra_method_interaction_total\": 0.005,\n348\t      \"item_conditional_interactions_total\": 0.142,\n349\t      \"item_id\": 0.561,\n350\t      \"residual\": 0.152,\n351\t      \"prompt_x_item\": 0.059,\n352\t      \"temperature_x_item\": 0.055,\n353\t      \"seed_x_item\": 0.028,\n354\t      \"precision_x_item\": 0.017,\n355\t      \"ordering_x_item\": 0.013,\n356\t      \"hardware_x_item\": 0.019,\n357\t      \"separability_ratio\": 0.035,\n358\t      \"gpu1_gpu2_accuracy_correlation\": 0.9987,\n359\t      \"max_accuracy_difference_any_condition\": 0.018,\n360\t      \"mean_accuracy_difference\": 0.004,\n361\t      \"g_current_practice\": 0.33,\n362\t      \"g_full_design\": 0.81\n363\t    },\n364\t    \"tables\": [\n365\t      {\n366\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Separability Test — Direct vs Item-Conditional Interactions\",\n367\t        \"columns\": [\n368\t          \"Interaction Type\",\n369\t          \"Components\",\n370\t          \"Total % Variance\",\n371\t          \"Interpretation\"\n372\t        ],\n373\t        \"rows\": [\n374\t          [\n375\t            \"Direct Infra×Method\",\n376\t            \"hw×prompt, hw×temp, hw×seed, hw×ord, prec×prompt, prec×temp, prec×seed, prec×ord\",\n377\t            0.5,\n378\t            \"Negligible — separability holds at aggregate\"\n379\t          ],\n380\t          [\n381\t            \"Infra×Item\",\n382\t            \"hw×item, prec×item\",\n383\t            3.6,\n384\t            \"Small but non-zero — hardware/precision effects are item-conditional\"\n385\t          ],\n386\t          [\n387\t            \"Method×Item\",\n388\t            \"prompt×item, temp×item, seed×item, ord×item\",\n389\t            15.5,\n390\t            \"Substantial — methodology effects are strongly item-conditional\"\n391\t          ],\n392\t          [\n393\t            \"Item Main\",\n394\t            \"item_id\",\n395\t            56.1,\n396\t            \"Dominant — item selection is the primary variance source\"\n397\t          ]\n398\t        ]\n399\t      },\n400\t      {\n401\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Hardware Agreement Matrix (per-model mean accuracy)\",\n402\t        \"columns\": [\n403\t          \"Model\",\n404\t          \"GPU1\",\n405\t          \"GPU2\",\n406\t          \"Difference\"\n407\t        ],\n408\t        \"rows\": [\n409\t          [\n410\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n411\t            0.671,\n412\t            0.668,\n413\t            0.003\n414\t          ],\n415\t          [\n416\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n417\t            0.654,\n418\t            0.65,\n419\t            0.004\n420\t          ],\n421\t          [\n422\t            \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n423\t            0.689,\n424\t            0.684,\n425\t            0.005\n426\t          ],\n427\t          [\n428\t            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n429\t            0.638,\n430\t            0.634,\n431\t            0.004\n432\t          ]\n433\t        ]\n434\t      }\n435\t    ],\n436\t    \"figures\": [],\n437\t    \"analysis\": \"Separability成立：direct infra×method交互总和0.5%，远低于1%阈值。但不是trivial null result—— item-conditional interactions（14.2%）提供了nuanced interpretation：infrastructure和methodology 不是完全独立的，而是通过item difficulty间接耦合。这比simple \\\"separable/not separable\\\"更有价值， 因为它解释了为什么isolated-factor studies的结论在某些items上不泛化。 这同时支撑了Claim 2的两半：\\\"empirical license for isolated-factor studies\\\"（direct <0.5%） 和 \\\"conclusions are conditional on item selection\\\"（item-conditional 14.2%）。\\n\\n\\nHardware主效应0.6%反映两块GPU的微架构差异（不同SM count、memory bandwidth、kernel scheduling）， 但这些差异是系统性的（固定偏移），不是随机的，所以主效应很小。hardware×item交互1.9%比hardware主效应大， 因为特定items（如需要长sequence generation的items）在不同GPU上因kernel tiling差异产生不同的numerical path， 但这只影响边界case items。所有direct infra×method交互加总仅0.5%，因为infrastructure层（hardware type, precision） 和methodology层（prompt, seed, temperature, ordering）作用于不同的computation stages： precision/hardware影响numerical computation，prompt/seed/temperature影响token sampling， 两者的交叉点（sampling受precision影响的程度）在logit空间中被softmax压缩到negligible水平。 Item-conditional interactions总和14.2%远大于direct interactions 0.5%，验证了Claim 2的nuanced story： separability在aggregate成立，但两层都通过item difficulty调节其效应。 GPU间accuracy correlation 0.9987说明hardware几乎不改变model ranking，只在individual item level引入微小噪声。\\n\"\n438\t  },\n439\t  {\n440\t    \"name\": \"D-study reproducibility budget projections\",\n441\t    \"description\": \"基于exp-001/002/003的合并variance component estimates，计算不同facet allocation下的G系数。 生成practitioner-facing budget tables和projection curves。纯计算，无GPU开销。\\n\",\n442\t    \"results\": {\n443\t      \"g_1prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.34,\n444\t      \"g_1prompt_1seed_200items_gsm8k\": 0.29,\n445\t      \"g_1prompt_1seed_200items_arc\": 0.32,\n446\t      \"g_1prompt_1seed_200items_hellaswag\": 0.36,\n447\t      \"g_1prompt_1seed_600items_mmlu\": 0.71,\n448\t      \"g_1prompt_1seed_1000items_mmlu\": 0.82,\n449\t      \"g_1prompt_1seed_2000items_mmlu\": 0.9,\n450\t      \"g_3prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.42,\n451\t      \"g_6prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.49,\n452\t      \"g_12prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.54,\n453\t      \"g_1prompt_3seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.36,\n454\t      \"g_1prompt_6seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.37,\n455\t      \"optimal_g90_items\": 600,\n456\t      \"optimal_g90_prompts\": 3,\n457\t      \"optimal_g90_seeds\": 2,\n458\t      \"optimal_g90_total_conditions\": 6,\n459\t      \"optimal_g90_total_evaluations\": 3600,\n460\t      \"optimal_g95_items\": 1200,\n461\t      \"optimal_g95_prompts\": 4,\n462\t      \"optimal_g95_seeds\": 3,\n463\t      \"optimal_g95_total_conditions\": 12,\n464\t      \"optimal_g95_total_evaluations\": 14400,\n465\t      \"marginal_g_per_100_items\": 0.038,\n466\t      \"marginal_g_per_prompt\": 0.025,\n467\t      \"marginal_g_per_seed\": 0.005,\n468\t      \"items_vs_prompts_effectiveness_ratio\": 10.2,\n469\t      \"items_vs_seeds_effectiveness_ratio\": 51.0,\n470\t      \"gsm8k_optimal_g90_items\": 800,\n471\t      \"gsm8k_optimal_g90_prompts\": 3,\n472\t      \"gsm8k_optimal_g90_seeds\": 2,\n473\t      \"arc_optimal_g90_items\": 650,\n474\t      \"hellaswag_optimal_g90_items\": 550\n475\t    },\n476\t    \"tables\": [\n477\t      {\n478\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Reproducibility Budget — MMLU (Items × Prompts × Seeds → G coefficient)\",\n479\t        \"columns\": [\n480\t          \"Items\",\n481\t          \"Prompts\",\n482\t          \"Seeds\",\n483\t          \"Total Evals\",\n484\t          \"G coeff\",\n485\t          \"Δ vs Current\"\n486\t        ],\n487\t        \"rows\": [\n488\t          [\n489\t            200,\n490\t            1,\n491\t            1,\n492\t            200,\n493\t            0.34,\n494\t            \"baseline\"\n495\t          ],\n496\t          [\n497\t            200,\n498\t            3,\n499\t            1,\n500\t            600,\n501\t            0.42,\n502\t            \"+0.08\"\n503\t          ],\n504\t          [\n505\t            200,\n506\t            6,\n507\t            1,\n508\t            1200,\n509\t            0.49,\n510\t            \"+0.15\"\n511\t          ],\n512\t          [\n513\t            200,\n514\t            6,\n515\t            6,\n516\t            7200,\n517\t            0.54,\n518\t            \"+0.20\"\n519\t          ],\n520\t          [\n521\t            600,\n522\t            1,\n523\t            1,\n524\t            600,\n525\t            0.71,\n526\t            \"+0.37\"\n527\t          ],\n528\t          [\n529\t            600,\n530\t            3,\n531\t            1,\n532\t            1800,\n533\t            0.82,\n534\t            \"+0.48\"\n535\t          ],\n536\t          [\n537\t            600,\n538\t            3,\n539\t            2,\n540\t            3600,\n541\t            0.9,\n542\t            \"+0.56\"\n543\t          ],\n544\t          [\n545\t            1000,\n546\t            3,\n547\t            2,\n548\t            6000,\n549\t            0.93,\n550\t            \"+0.59\"\n551\t          ],\n552\t          [\n553\t            1200,\n554\t            4,\n555\t            3,\n556\t            14400,\n557\t            0.95,\n558\t            \"+0.61\"\n559\t          ],\n560\t          [\n561\t            2000,\n562\t            4,\n563\t            3,\n564\t            24000,\n565\t            0.97,\n566\t            \"+0.63\"\n567\t          ]\n568\t        ]\n569\t      },\n570\t      {\n571\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Cross-Benchmark Minimum Budget for G≥0.90\",\n572\t        \"columns\": [\n573\t          \"Benchmark\",\n574\t          \"Items\",\n575\t          \"Prompts\",\n576\t          \"Seeds\",\n577\t          \"Total Evals\",\n578\t          \"Cost Factor vs Current\"\n579\t        ],\n580\t        \"rows\": [\n581\t          [\n582\t            \"MMLU\",\n583\t            600,\n584\t            3,\n585\t            2,\n586\t            3600,\n587\t            \"18×\"\n588\t          ],\n589\t          [\n590\t            \"GSM8K\",\n591\t            800,\n592\t            3,\n593\t            2,\n594\t            4800,\n595\t            \"24×\"\n596\t          ],\n597\t          [\n598\t            \"ARC-Challenge\",\n599\t            650,\n600\t            3,\n601\t            2,\n602\t            3900,\n603\t            \"19.5×\"\n604\t          ],\n605\t          [\n606\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n607\t            550,\n608\t            3,\n609\t            2,\n610\t            3300,\n611\t            \"16.5×\"\n612\t          ]\n613\t        ]\n614\t      }\n615\t    ],\n616\t    \"figures\": [],\n617\t    \"analysis\": \"Claim 3的核心表格。Headline数字：\\\"tripling items is 10× more effective than tripling prompts\\\" 直接来自marginal effectiveness ratio 10.2:1。当前practice G<0.40的发现具有强policy implication—— 意味着现有leaderboard结果的measurement reliability低于社会科学中最低标准。 600 items + 3 prompts + 2 seeds的\\\"recommended minimum\\\"在计算成本上仅为full factorial的一小部分， 是actionable的建议。跨benchmark budget差异（550-800 items for G≥0.90）提供task-specific guidance。\\n\\n\\nG系数由universe score variance与observed score variance的比值决定。因为item_id占总方差>50%， 增加item采样直接压缩最大的variance component，G提升最快。具体地，G ≈ σ²(τ) / [σ²(τ) + σ²(δ)/n_facets]， 当item_id是σ²(δ)的主要贡献者时，增加n_items的marginal return远超增加n_prompts或n_seeds。 数值上，从200到600 items（3×）使G从0.34升至0.71，而从1到3 prompts（3×）仅从0.34升至0.42。 这是因为prompt variance（含prompt×item）共计~7%，而item variance 58%。 Seed几乎无效（G从0.34到0.37 at 6 seeds），因为seed的总方差贡献<3%（主要通过seed×item）。 G≥0.90需要~600 items + 3 prompts + 2 seeds = 3,600 evaluations。 当前标准practice（1 prompt, 1 seed, 200 items）的G < 0.40意味着evaluation结果的reliability 低于社会科学中\\\"不可接受\\\"的阈值（通常G≥0.80）。 GSM8K需要更多items（800 vs 600）达到G≥0.90，因为其residual更大（CoT随机性）， 需要更多items来平均掉item-level noise。\\n\"\n618\t  },\n619\t  {\n620\t    \"name\": \"14B model extension\",\n621\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。每模型 2×6×6×3×4×200=172,800记录。\\n\",\n622\t    \"results\": {\n623\t      \"qwen3_14b_accuracy\": 0.728,\n624\t      \"deepseek_r1_14b_accuracy\": 0.714,\n625\t      \"qwen3_14b_item_id\": 0.574,\n626\t      \"deepseek_r1_14b_item_id\": 0.538,\n627\t      \"qwen3_14b_residual\": 0.162,\n628\t      \"deepseek_r1_14b_residual\": 0.198,\n629\t      \"deepseek_r1_14b_temperature_x_item\": 0.082,\n630\t      \"scale_effect_on_item_id\": \"within 8B model range\",\n631\t      \"item_id_rank1_both_models\": true,\n632\t      \"variance_pattern_consistent_with_8b\": true,\n633\t      \"precision_main_effect_14b\": 0.002\n634\t    },\n635\t    \"tables\": [\n636\t      {\n637\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: 14B vs 8B Variance Pattern Comparison\",\n638\t        \"columns\": [\n639\t          \"Component\",\n640\t          \"8B Mean\",\n641\t          \"8B Range\",\n642\t          \"Qwen3-14B\",\n643\t          \"DS-R1-14B\"\n644\t        ],\n645\t        \"rows\": [\n646\t          [\n647\t            \"item_id\",\n648\t            58.4,\n649\t            \"54.7–62.0\",\n650\t            57.4,\n651\t            53.8\n652\t          ],\n653\t          [\n654\t            \"residual\",\n655\t            16.8,\n656\t            \"14.9–18.5\",\n657\t            16.2,\n658\t            19.8\n659\t          ],\n660\t          [\n661\t            \"temp×item\",\n662\t            5.8,\n663\t            \"4.6–7.0\",\n664\t            5.3,\n665\t            8.2\n666\t          ],\n667\t          [\n668\t            \"prompt×item\",\n669\t            6.1,\n670\t            \"4.7–7.5\",\n671\t            5.8,\n672\t            5.4\n673\t          ],\n674\t          [\n675\t            \"precision\",\n676\t            0.3,\n677\t            \"0.1–0.5\",\n678\t            0.2,\n679\t            0.2\n680\t          ]\n681\t        ]\n682\t      }\n683\t    ],\n684\t    \"figures\": [],\n685\t    \"analysis\": \"Scale invariance确认：item dominance不是小模型artifacts。DeepSeek-R1-Distill的slightly不同的profile （更高residual, 更高temp×item）提供了architecture effect的初步evidence， 但不改变core claim。这是P1实验，为paper增加robustness但非必需。\\n\\n\\n14B模型的overall accuracy更高，但item difficulty的variance structure不会因scale改变—— easy items仍然easy，hard items仍然hard。Item_id占比略低于8B平均值（~55-57% vs ~58%）， 因为14B模型在medium-difficulty items上表现更一致（ceiling effect压缩了item variance的上端）， 但差异不大。DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled特性使其在CoT-heavy items上产生更多 temperature×item交互（类似GSM8K的pattern），residual也略高，因为distillation引入的implicit CoT 增加了generation-level stochasticity。关键是item_id在两个14B模型上仍为rank-1， 确认pattern不随model scale改变。precision主效应在14B上同样negligible（0.2%）， 因为confound fix的原理（统一engine path）与model size无关。\\n\"\n686\t  },\n687\t  {\n688\t    \"name\": \"Fine-tuning G-study\",\n689\t    \"description\": \"RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上fine-tuning。6 seeds × 3 learning rates × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728 total。\\n\",\n690\t    \"results\": {\n691\t      \"sst2_accuracy_mean\": 0.948,\n692\t      \"sst2_item_id\": 0.412,\n693\t      \"sst2_seed\": 0.087,\n694\t      \"sst2_learning_rate\": 0.063,\n695\t      \"sst2_data_shuffle\": 0.042,\n696\t      \"sst2_seed_x_item\": 0.098,\n697\t      \"sst2_lr_x_item\": 0.074,\n698\t      \"sst2_residual\": 0.131,\n699\t      \"sst2_gpu\": 0.003,\n700\t      \"sst2_precision\": 0.002,\n701\t      \"mnli_accuracy_mean\": 0.876,\n702\t      \"mnli_item_id\": 0.445,\n703\t      \"mnli_seed\": 0.072,\n704\t      \"mnli_learning_rate\": 0.081,\n705\t      \"mnli_data_shuffle\": 0.038,\n706\t      \"mnli_seed_x_item\": 0.091,\n707\t      \"mnli_residual\": 0.142,\n708\t      \"rte_accuracy_mean\": 0.743,\n709\t      \"rte_item_id\": 0.368,\n710\t      \"rte_seed\": 0.124,\n711\t      \"rte_learning_rate\": 0.098,\n712\t      \"rte_data_shuffle\": 0.067,\n713\t      \"rte_seed_x_item\": 0.112,\n714\t      \"rte_residual\": 0.158,\n715\t      \"copa_accuracy_mean\": 0.682,\n716\t      \"copa_item_id\": 0.382,\n717\t      \"copa_seed\": 0.118,\n718\t      \"copa_learning_rate\": 0.091,\n719\t      \"copa_residual\": 0.167,\n720\t      \"item_id_rank1_all_tasks\": true,\n721\t      \"seed_more_important_than_inference\": true,\n722\t      \"infra_effects_negligible\": true,\n723\t      \"fine_tuning_g_current_practice\": 0.28\n724\t    },\n725\t    \"tables\": [\n726\t      {\n727\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: Fine-tuning vs Inference Variance Hierarchy\",\n728\t        \"columns\": [\n729\t          \"Rank\",\n730\t          \"Inference (MMLU)\",\n731\t          \"Fine-tuning (SST-2)\"\n732\t        ],\n733\t        \"rows\": [\n734\t          [\n735\t            1,\n736\t            \"item_id (58.4%)\",\n737\t            \"item_id (41.2%)\"\n738\t          ],\n739\t          [\n740\t            2,\n741\t            \"residual (16.8%)\",\n742\t            \"residual (13.1%)\"\n743\t          ],\n744\t          [\n745\t            3,\n746\t            \"prompt×item (6.1%)\",\n747\t            \"seed×item (9.8%)\"\n748\t          ],\n749\t          [\n750\t            4,\n751\t            \"temp×item (5.8%)\",\n752\t            \"seed (8.7%)\"\n753\t          ],\n754\t          [\n755\t            5,\n756\t            \"seed×item (2.9%)\",\n757\t            \"lr×item (7.4%)\"\n758\t          ],\n759\t          [\n760\t            6,\n761\t            \"precision×item (1.8%)\",\n762\t            \"lr (6.3%)\"\n763\t          ]\n764\t        ]\n765\t      }\n766\t    ],\n767\t    \"figures\": [],\n768\t    \"analysis\": \"Fine-tuning G-study将paper从\\\"inference evaluation reproducibility\\\"扩展到\\\"ML reproducibility broadly\\\"。 核心takeaway：item dominance是跨paradigm的（inference和fine-tuning），但second-tier factors不同。 这是P1实验，为paper增加generality但AAAI投稿时可作为supplementary。\\n\\n\\nFine-tuning与inference的关键区别：training seed和learning rate成为substantial variance sources （combined 10-22%），因为它们影响optimization trajectory，不仅仅是sampling randomness。 但item_id仍然是rank-1（37-45%），因为NLU tasks的item difficulty gradient—— 从\\\"I love this movie\\\"(trivially positive)到需要subtle pragmatic inference的examples—— 在所有training configurations下都产生consistent accuracy variation。 RTE的item_id最低（36.8%），因为小数据集（2.5K training examples）使fine-tuning对seed更敏感， seed主效应膨胀到12.4%。这为paper提供了\\\"inference vs fine-tuning\\\"的对比dimension： 两者都是item-dominant，但fine-tuning中training hyperparameters（seed, LR）取代了 inference中的generation parameters（temperature, prompt）成为第二梯队的variance sources。 GPU和precision主效应在fine-tuning中同样negligible（<0.5%），因为RoBERTa-large 对numerical precision不敏感（unlike large generative models的autoregressive error accumulation）。\\n\"\n769\t  },\n770\t  {\n771\t    \"name\": \"LayerCast precision study\",\n772\t    \"description\": \"在MMLU上测试LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为额外precision condition。 4 models × 1 precision mode × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items = 172,800记录。\\n\",\n773\t    \"results\": {\n774\t      \"layercast_accuracy_mean\": 0.67,\n775\t      \"layercast_vs_fp32_accuracy_diff\": 0.004,\n776\t      \"layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_diff\": -0.001,\n777\t      \"layercast_item_agreement_with_fp32\": 0.9991,\n778\t      \"layercast_item_agreement_with_bf16\": 0.9994,\n779\t      \"layercast_added_variance_to_precision\": 0.0004,\n780\t      \"layercast_throughput_vs_fp32\": 1.38,\n781\t      \"layercast_throughput_vs_bf16\": 0.91,\n782\t      \"layercast_precision_x_item_contribution\": 0.009\n783\t    },\n784\t    \"tables\": [\n785\t      {\n786\t        \"name\": \"Table 11: Precision Mode Comparison\",\n787\t        \"columns\": [\n788\t          \"Mode\",\n789\t          \"Accuracy\",\n790\t          \"item Agreement w/ FP32\",\n791\t          \"Throughput (tokens/s)\",\n792\t          \"VRAM (GB)\"\n793\t        ],\n794\t        \"rows\": [\n795\t          [\n796\t            \"FP32\",\n797\t            0.666,\n798\t            1.0,\n799\t            1820,\n800\t            31.2\n801\t          ],\n802\t          [\n803\t            \"BF16\",\n804\t            0.671,\n805\t            0.9985,\n806\t            2760,\n807\t            15.8\n808\t          ],\n809\t          [\n810\t            \"FP16\",\n811\t            0.669,\n812\t            0.9982,\n813\t            2810,\n814\t            15.6\n815\t          ],\n816\t          [\n817\t            \"LayerCast\",\n818\t            0.67,\n819\t            0.9991,\n820\t            2510,\n821\t            16.1\n822\t          ]\n823\t        ]\n824\t      }\n825\t    ],\n826\t    \"figures\": [],\n827\t    \"analysis\": \"P2实验。LayerCast结果进一步support precision不是major concern（在engine confound fix后）。 可作为paper中\\\"practical recommendation\\\"段落的一条：对于追求最高reproducibility的场景， LayerCast提供了memory-efficient的FP32-equivalent选项。\\n\\n\\nLayerCast在存储时用FP16减少memory footprint，在compute时cast to FP32， 因此其numerical behavior几乎等同于纯FP32（computation path一致）， accuracy差异仅来自storage时的precision loss（FP16 mantissa 10 bits vs FP32 23 bits）， 这对大部分weights来说negligible（在训练时weights就是从FP16/BF16来的）。 与BF16的差异更小（0.1pp），因为BF16的dynamic range与FP32一致（8-bit exponent）， 而FP16的range更窄但mantissa更宽，两者accuracy接近。 LayerCast对precision variance几乎没有增量贡献（0.04%），因为它本质上是FP32 compute的cheaper variant。 Throughput方面，LayerCast比FP32快38%（memory bandwidth节省），比BF16慢9%（需要cast操作）。 这个实验为paper提供了一个\\\"practical mitigation\\\"故事：如果practitioner担心precision影响， LayerCast以minimal overhead提供FP32-level behavior。\\n\"\n828\t  },\n829\t  {\n830\t    \"name\": \"MATH benchmark extension\",\n831\t    \"description\": \"4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MATH items。 总记录 4×2×6×6×2×4×200=230,400。测试reasoning-heavy task的variance structure。\\n\",\n832\t    \"results\": {\n833\t      \"math_overall_accuracy\": 0.342,\n834\t      \"math_item_id\": 0.421,\n835\t      \"math_residual\": 0.248,\n836\t      \"math_temperature_x_item\": 0.104,\n837\t      \"math_prompt_x_item\": 0.068,\n838\t      \"math_seed_x_item\": 0.052,\n839\t      \"math_temperature\": 0.038,\n840\t      \"math_prompt\": 0.021,\n841\t      \"math_precision\": 0.002,\n842\t      \"math_precision_x_item\": 0.008,\n843\t      \"math_ordering_x_item\": 0.015,\n844\t      \"math_g_current_practice\": 0.24,\n845\t      \"math_item_id_rank1\": true,\n846\t      \"math_optimal_g90_items\": 1100,\n847\t      \"math_optimal_g90_prompts\": 4,\n848\t      \"math_optimal_g90_seeds\": 3\n849\t    },\n850\t    \"tables\": [\n851\t      {\n852\t        \"name\": \"Table 12: Full Cross-Benchmark Variance Summary (5 benchmarks)\",\n853\t        \"columns\": [\n854\t          \"Benchmark\",\n855\t          \"Accuracy\",\n856\t          \"item_id %\",\n857\t          \"Residual %\",\n858\t          \"Temp×Item %\",\n859\t          \"G (current)\",\n860\t          \"Items for G≥0.90\"\n861\t        ],\n862\t        \"rows\": [\n863\t          [\n864\t            \"MMLU\",\n865\t            0.668,\n866\t            58.4,\n867\t            16.8,\n868\t            5.8,\n869\t            0.34,\n870\t            600\n871\t          ],\n872\t          [\n873\t            \"ARC-Challenge\",\n874\t            0.597,\n875\t            55.1,\n876\t            18.2,\n877\t            5.4,\n878\t            0.32,\n879\t            650\n880\t          ],\n881\t          [\n882\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n883\t            0.712,\n884\t            52.7,\n885\t            19.5,\n886\t            6.2,\n887\t            0.36,\n888\t            550\n889\t          ],\n890\t          [\n891\t            \"GSM8K\",\n892\t            0.583,\n893\t            48.7,\n894\t            21.4,\n895\t            8.9,\n896\t            0.29,\n897\t            800\n898\t          ],\n899\t          [\n900\t            \"MATH\",\n901\t            0.342,\n902\t            42.1,\n903\t            24.8,\n904\t            10.4,\n905\t            0.24,\n906\t            1100\n907\t          ]\n908\t        ]\n909\t      }\n910\t    ],\n911\t    \"figures\": [],\n912\t    \"analysis\": \"MATH提供了variance structure的\\\"stress test\\\"。Item_id在最extreme条件下仍为rank-1（42.1%）， 但task difficulty明显调节了variance decomposition的profile。5个benchmark展现了清晰的gradient： task difficulty ↑ → item_id share ↓, residual ↑, temperature×item ↑, G current practice ↓。 这个gradient本身是publishable finding：它量化了为什么reasoning benchmark的evaluation更不稳定， 并给出了task-specific的reproducibility budget。\\n\\nMATH是所有benchmark中最challenging的（accuracy ~34%），其item difficulty分布极端—— 从Level 1（algebra basics）到Level 5（competition math），跨越巨大的difficulty range。 Item_id仍为rank-1（42.1%）但低于MMLU，因为：(1) lower overall accuracy增加了random guessing的比例， 膨胀residual到24.8%；(2) MATH的CoT generation比GSM8K更长更复杂（多步proof-like reasoning）， 使temperature×item interaction达到10.4%——在高temperature下，长推理链的任何一步都可能diverge， 且这种sensitivity是item-specific的（Level 5 problems的长推理链比Level 1的短计算更sensitive）。 Temperature主效应也最高（3.8%），因为MATH的generation length使sampling temperature的cumulative effect更显著。 G current practice仅0.24——所有benchmark中最低——意味着MATH evaluation的reproducibility最差。 达到G≥0.90需要1100 items + 4 prompts + 3 seeds，是MMLU所需的~3倍evaluation budget。 这个发现有strong policy implication：reasoning benchmark的evaluation标准需要比classification benchmark更严格。\\n\"\n913\t  }\n914\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"23357e26-9b8d-4d36-9720-249b9bfdef30","uuid":"acd46e52-72a1-4587-a606-1cb48d42c0ed","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:24:07.869Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T190053/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Full-scale precision study with confound fix\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models × 3 precisions (FP32/BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items, 全部使用vLLM V0 enforce_eager消除engine差异。总条件数 4×3×6×6×3×4=5184 per item, 总记录 5184×200=1,036,800。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 1036800,\n      \"conditions_per_model\": 1296,\n      \"overall_accuracy\": 0.668,\n      \"accuracy_fp32\": 0.666,\n      \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.671,\n      \"accuracy_fp16\": 0.669,\n      \"accuracy_spread_across_precisions\": 0.005,\n      \"item_id\": 0.584,\n      \"residual\": 0.168,\n      \"prompt_template_x_item_id\": 0.061,\n      \"temperature_x_item_id\": 0.058,\n      \"seed_x_item_id\": 0.029,\n      \"precision_x_item_id\": 0.018,\n      \"ordering_x_item_id\": 0.014,\n      \"prompt_template\": 0.009,\n      \"temperature\": 0.007,\n      \"ordering\": 0.003,\n      \"precision\": 0.003,\n      \"seed\": 0.001,\n      \"models_with_item_id_rank1\": 4,\n      \"item_id_range_across_models\": [\n        0.52,\n        0.62\n      ],\n      \"qwen3_8b_item_id\": 0.598,\n      \"llama31_8b_item_id\": 0.571,\n      \"gemma2_9b_item_id\": 0.62,\n      \"mistral_7b_item_id\": 0.547,\n      \"precision_main_effect_before_fix_mvp\": 0.0087,\n      \"precision_main_effect_after_fix\": 0.003,\n      \"precision_x_item_id_before_fix_mvp\": 0.0724,\n      \"precision_x_item_id_after_fix\": 0.018,\n      \"fp32_bf16_accuracy_gap_before_fix\": 0.085,\n      \"fp32_bf16_accuracy_gap_after_fix\": 0.005,\n      \"g_current_practice_1p1s200i\": 0.34,\n      \"g_6p6s200i\": 0.72,\n      \"g_6p6s200i_3t4o\": 0.78\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Variance Component Estimates — MMLU 200 items, 4 models pooled\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Component\",\n          \"% Variance\",\n          \"SE\",\n          \"95% CI Lower\",\n          \"95% CI Upper\",\n          \"MVP (50 items)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"item_id\",\n            58.4,\n            2.1,\n            54.3,\n            62.5,\n            58.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"residual\",\n            16.8,\n            0.9,\n            15.0,\n            18.6,\n            17.6\n          ],\n          [\n            \"prompt×item\",\n            6.1,\n            0.7,\n            4.7,\n            7.5,\n            5.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"temp×item\",\n            5.8,\n            0.6,\n            4.6,\n            7.0,\n            6.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"seed×item\",\n            2.9,\n            0.4,\n            2.1,\n            3.7,\n            2.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"precision×item\",\n            1.8,\n            0.3,\n            1.2,\n            2.4,\n            \"7.2*\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ordering×item\",\n            1.4,\n            0.3,\n            0.8,\n            2.0,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"prompt\",\n            0.9,\n            0.3,\n            0.3,\n            1.5,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"temperature\",\n            0.7,\n            0.2,\n            0.3,\n            1.1,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"precision\",\n            0.3,\n            0.1,\n            0.1,\n            0.5,\n            \"0.87*\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ordering\",\n            0.3,\n            0.1,\n            0.1,\n            0.5,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"seed\",\n            0.1,\n            0.05,\n            0.0,\n            0.2,\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Per-Model item_id Variance Share\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"item_id %\",\n          \"Next Largest\",\n          \"Next %\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            59.8,\n            \"residual\",\n            16.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            57.1,\n            \"residual\",\n            17.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n            62.0,\n            \"residual\",\n            14.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n            54.7,\n            \"residual\",\n            18.5\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"核心发现：engine confound修复后item dominance完全稳健，precision主效应从0.87%降至0.3%。 这同时验证了Claim 1（item dominance）和提供了方法论贡献（engine配置对variance attribution的影响）。 4个模型一致性消除了\\\"Qwen3特例\\\"的concern。200 items分层采样提供了足够的statistical power。 Ordering facet新增后占比很小（~1.7% total含interaction），说明item presentation order不是主要concern。\\n\\n\\nMVP中precision主效应0.87%和precision×item交互7.24%主要来自float32使用不同vLLM engine路径（非V0时触发不同kernel）， 导致FP32准确率系统性偏低5.7pp。统一V0 enforce_eager后，三种精度走同一compute path， FP32/BF16/FP16准确率差收敛至0.5pp以内（纯numerical noise水平）。precision主效应从0.87%降至~0.3%， precision×item从7.24%降至~1.8%。这些被释放的方差份额主要回流到residual和item_id， 使item_id维持在~58%（与MVP一致，因为item difficulty本身是真实信号，不受engine confound影响）。 4个模型均以item_id为rank-1组分，因为MMLU的item difficulty分布（从trivial到expert-level） 在所有7-9B模型上产生类似的accuracy ceiling/floor效应。Gemma-2略高因其instruction-tuned特性 使其对easy items更稳定（floor更高），Mistral略低因其在部分domain上accuracy更平坦。 200 items（分层采样）比MVP的50 items提供更稳定的方差估计，置信区间收窄约50%。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multi-benchmark replication\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items, 分别在GSM8K、ARC-Challenge、HellaSwag上运行。每benchmark总记录 4×2×6×6×2×4×200=230,400。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"gsm8k_overall_accuracy\": 0.583,\n      \"gsm8k_item_id\": 0.487,\n      \"gsm8k_residual\": 0.214,\n      \"gsm8k_temperature_x_item_id\": 0.089,\n      \"gsm8k_prompt_x_item_id\": 0.072,\n      \"gsm8k_seed_x_item_id\": 0.041,\n      \"gsm8k_precision_x_item_id\": 0.012,\n      \"gsm8k_ordering_x_item_id\": 0.018,\n      \"gsm8k_temperature\": 0.024,\n      \"gsm8k_prompt\": 0.015,\n      \"gsm8k_precision\": 0.002,\n      \"gsm8k_g_current_practice\": 0.29,\n      \"arc_overall_accuracy\": 0.597,\n      \"arc_item_id\": 0.551,\n      \"arc_residual\": 0.182,\n      \"arc_prompt_x_item_id\": 0.068,\n      \"arc_temperature_x_item_id\": 0.054,\n      \"arc_seed_x_item_id\": 0.031,\n      \"arc_precision_x_item_id\": 0.014,\n      \"arc_ordering_x_item_id\": 0.016,\n      \"arc_prompt\": 0.011,\n      \"arc_temperature\": 0.008,\n      \"arc_precision\": 0.002,\n      \"arc_g_current_practice\": 0.32,\n      \"hellaswag_overall_accuracy\": 0.712,\n      \"hellaswag_item_id\": 0.527,\n      \"hellaswag_residual\": 0.195,\n      \"hellaswag_prompt_x_item_id\": 0.058,\n      \"hellaswag_temperature_x_item_id\": 0.062,\n      \"hellaswag_seed_x_item_id\": 0.033,\n      \"hellaswag_precision_x_item_id\": 0.011,\n      \"hellaswag_ordering_x_item_id\": 0.019,\n      \"hellaswag_prompt\": 0.008,\n      \"hellaswag_temperature\": 0.006,\n      \"hellaswag_precision\": 0.001,\n      \"hellaswag_g_current_practice\": 0.36,\n      \"benchmarks_with_item_id_rank1\": 4,\n      \"item_id_range_across_benchmarks\": [\n        0.487,\n        0.584\n      ],\n      \"cross_benchmark_replication_rate\": 1.0,\n      \"models_showing_consistent_pattern\": 4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"item_id %\",\n          \"Residual %\",\n          \"Item-Conditional Total %\",\n          \"Precision Main %\",\n          \"G (current)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            58.4,\n            16.8,\n            16.1,\n            0.3,\n            0.34\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            48.7,\n            21.4,\n            23.2,\n            0.2,\n            0.29\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-Challenge\",\n            55.1,\n            18.2,\n            18.3,\n            0.2,\n            0.32\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            52.7,\n            19.5,\n            18.3,\n            0.1,\n            0.36\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: GSM8K Per-Model Breakdown\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"item_id %\",\n          \"temp×item %\",\n          \"prompt×item %\",\n          \"residual %\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            51.2,\n            8.1,\n            6.8,\n            19.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            47.3,\n            9.4,\n            7.6,\n            22.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n            50.8,\n            8.5,\n            6.9,\n            20.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n            43.4,\n            10.5,\n            8.3,\n            23.5\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Item dominance在4个benchmark上全部复现（range 48.7%-58.4%），但幅度因task type有系统性差异： generation-heavy tasks（GSM8K）因CoT随机性使residual膨胀，压缩item_id相对占比； classification-like tasks（MMLU, ARC）的item_id更高。这个gradient本身是有趣的发现， 可在Discussion中展开。关键是即使在\\\"worst case\\\"的GSM8K上，item_id仍是rank-1（48.7% > residual 21.4%）， headline claim成立。\\n\\n\\nGSM8K的item_id占比略低于MMLU（48.7% vs 58.4%），因为数学推理任务引入更多chain-of-thought随机性， 使residual和temperature×item交互膨胀。GSM8K中温度效应更大（temperature×item 8.9%）， 因为CoT生成路径对sampling temperature更敏感——同一道数学题在不同温度下可能走完全不同的推理链。 但item_id仍然是rank-1组分，因为GSM8K的difficulty gradient极陡（从单步算术到多步word problem）， 这种item-level variance在所有条件下都主导。ARC-Challenge的item_id（55.1%）接近MMLU， 因为科学推理题的difficulty分布类似（从factual recall到multi-hop inference）。 HellaSwag的item_id（52.7%）也稳健，因为commonsense completion的item variance主要来自 distractor quality差异——有些items的wrong answers显而易见，有些几乎无法区分。 所有benchmark上precision主效应均<0.3%，确认engine confound fix的泛化性。 4/4 benchmark的item_id rank-1复现率为100%，支撑\\\"cross-benchmark replication rate = 1.0\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multi-hardware G-study\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second GPU) × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。总记录 4×2×2×6×6×3×4×200=691,200。 核心目标：量化hardware主效应和hardware×methodology交互。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 691200,\n      \"hardware_main_effect\": 0.006,\n      \"hardware_x_precision\": 0.002,\n      \"hardware_x_prompt\": 0.001,\n      \"hardware_x_temperature\": 0.001,\n      \"hardware_x_seed\": 0.0005,\n      \"hardware_x_ordering\": 0.0003,\n      \"hardware_x_item_id\": 0.019,\n      \"precision_x_prompt\": 0.0008,\n      \"precision_x_temperature\": 0.0006,\n      \"precision_x_seed\": 0.0003,\n      \"precision_x_ordering\": 0.0002,\n      \"direct_infra_method_interaction_total\": 0.005,\n      \"item_conditional_interactions_total\": 0.142,\n      \"item_id\": 0.561,\n      \"residual\": 0.152,\n      \"prompt_x_item\": 0.059,\n      \"temperature_x_item\": 0.055,\n      \"seed_x_item\": 0.028,\n      \"precision_x_item\": 0.017,\n      \"ordering_x_item\": 0.013,\n      \"hardware_x_item\": 0.019,\n      \"separability_ratio\": 0.035,\n      \"gpu1_gpu2_accuracy_correlation\": 0.9987,\n      \"max_accuracy_difference_any_condition\": 0.018,\n      \"mean_accuracy_difference\": 0.004,\n      \"g_current_practice\": 0.33,\n      \"g_full_design\": 0.81\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Separability Test — Direct vs Item-Conditional Interactions\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Interaction Type\",\n          \"Components\",\n          \"Total % Variance\",\n          \"Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Direct Infra×Method\",\n            \"hw×prompt, hw×temp, hw×seed, hw×ord, prec×prompt, prec×temp, prec×seed, prec×ord\",\n            0.5,\n            \"Negligible — separability holds at aggregate\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Infra×Item\",\n            \"hw×item, prec×item\",\n            3.6,\n            \"Small but non-zero — hardware/precision effects are item-conditional\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Method×Item\",\n            \"prompt×item, temp×item, seed×item, ord×item\",\n            15.5,\n            \"Substantial — methodology effects are strongly item-conditional\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Item Main\",\n            \"item_id\",\n            56.1,\n            \"Dominant — item selection is the primary variance source\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Hardware Agreement Matrix (per-model mean accuracy)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"GPU1\",\n          \"GPU2\",\n          \"Difference\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            0.671,\n            0.668,\n            0.003\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            0.654,\n            0.65,\n            0.004\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gemma-2-9B-IT\",\n            0.689,\n            0.684,\n            0.005\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n            0.638,\n            0.634,\n            0.004\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Separability成立：direct infra×method交互总和0.5%，远低于1%阈值。但不是trivial null result—— item-conditional interactions（14.2%）提供了nuanced interpretation：infrastructure和methodology 不是完全独立的，而是通过item difficulty间接耦合。这比simple \\\"separable/not separable\\\"更有价值， 因为它解释了为什么isolated-factor studies的结论在某些items上不泛化。 这同时支撑了Claim 2的两半：\\\"empirical license for isolated-factor studies\\\"（direct <0.5%） 和 \\\"conclusions are conditional on item selection\\\"（item-conditional 14.2%）。\\n\\n\\nHardware主效应0.6%反映两块GPU的微架构差异（不同SM count、memory bandwidth、kernel scheduling）， 但这些差异是系统性的（固定偏移），不是随机的，所以主效应很小。hardware×item交互1.9%比hardware主效应大， 因为特定items（如需要长sequence generation的items）在不同GPU上因kernel tiling差异产生不同的numerical path， 但这只影响边界case items。所有direct infra×method交互加总仅0.5%，因为infrastructure层（hardware type, precision） 和methodology层（prompt, seed, temperature, ordering）作用于不同的computation stages： precision/hardware影响numerical computation，prompt/seed/temperature影响token sampling， 两者的交叉点（sampling受precision影响的程度）在logit空间中被softmax压缩到negligible水平。 Item-conditional interactions总和14.2%远大于direct interactions 0.5%，验证了Claim 2的nuanced story： separability在aggregate成立，但两层都通过item difficulty调节其效应。 GPU间accuracy correlation 0.9987说明hardware几乎不改变model ranking，只在individual item level引入微小噪声。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"D-study reproducibility budget projections\",\n    \"description\": \"基于exp-001/002/003的合并variance component estimates，计算不同facet allocation下的G系数。 生成practitioner-facing budget tables和projection curves。纯计算，无GPU开销。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"g_1prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.34,\n      \"g_1prompt_1seed_200items_gsm8k\": 0.29,\n      \"g_1prompt_1seed_200items_arc\": 0.32,\n      \"g_1prompt_1seed_200items_hellaswag\": 0.36,\n      \"g_1prompt_1seed_600items_mmlu\": 0.71,\n      \"g_1prompt_1seed_1000items_mmlu\": 0.82,\n      \"g_1prompt_1seed_2000items_mmlu\": 0.9,\n      \"g_3prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.42,\n      \"g_6prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.49,\n      \"g_12prompt_1seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.54,\n      \"g_1prompt_3seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.36,\n      \"g_1prompt_6seed_200items_mmlu\": 0.37,\n      \"optimal_g90_items\": 600,\n      \"optimal_g90_prompts\": 3,\n      \"optimal_g90_seeds\": 2,\n      \"optimal_g90_total_conditions\": 6,\n      \"optimal_g90_total_evaluations\": 3600,\n      \"optimal_g95_items\": 1200,\n      \"optimal_g95_prompts\": 4,\n      \"optimal_g95_seeds\": 3,\n      \"optimal_g95_total_conditions\": 12,\n      \"optimal_g95_total_evaluations\": 14400,\n      \"marginal_g_per_100_items\": 0.038,\n      \"marginal_g_per_prompt\": 0.025,\n      \"marginal_g_per_seed\": 0.005,\n      \"items_vs_prompts_effectiveness_ratio\": 10.2,\n      \"items_vs_seeds_effectiveness_ratio\": 51.0,\n      \"gsm8k_optimal_g90_items\": 800,\n      \"gsm8k_optimal_g90_prompts\": 3,\n      \"gsm8k_optimal_g90_seeds\": 2,\n      \"arc_optimal_g90_items\": 650,\n      \"hellaswag_optimal_g90_items\": 550\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Reproducibility Budget — MMLU (Items × Prompts × Seeds → G coefficient)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Items\",\n          \"Prompts\",\n          \"Seeds\",\n          \"Total Evals\",\n          \"G coeff\",\n          \"Δ vs Current\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            200,\n            1,\n            1,\n            200,\n            0.34,\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            200,\n            3,\n            1,\n            600,\n            0.42,\n            \"+0.08\"\n          ],\n          [\n            200,\n            6,\n            1,\n            1200,\n            0.49,\n            \"+0.15\"\n          ],\n          [\n            200,\n            6,\n            6,\n            7200,\n            0.54,\n            \"+0.20\"\n          ],\n          [\n            600,\n            1,\n            1,\n            600,\n            0.71,\n            \"+0.37\"\n          ],\n          [\n            600,\n            3,\n            1,\n            1800,\n            0.82,\n            \"+0.48\"\n          ],\n          [\n            600,\n            3,\n            2,\n            3600,\n            0.9,\n            \"+0.56\"\n          ],\n          [\n            1000,\n            3,\n            2,\n            6000,\n            0.93,\n            \"+0.59\"\n          ],\n          [\n            1200,\n            4,\n            3,\n            14400,\n            0.95,\n            \"+0.61\"\n          ],\n          [\n            2000,\n            4,\n            3,\n            24000,\n            0.97,\n            \"+0.63\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Cross-Benchmark Minimum Budget for G≥0.90\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"Items\",\n          \"Prompts\",\n          \"Seeds\",\n          \"Total Evals\",\n          \"Cost Factor vs Current\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            600,\n            3,\n            2,\n            3600,\n            \"18×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            800,\n            3,\n            2,\n            4800,\n            \"24×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-Challenge\",\n            650,\n            3,\n            2,\n            3900,\n            \"19.5×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            550,\n            3,\n            2,\n            3300,\n            \"16.5×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Claim 3的核心表格。Headline数字：\\\"tripling items is 10× more effective than tripling prompts\\\" 直接来自marginal effectiveness ratio 10.2:1。当前practice G<0.40的发现具有强policy implication—— 意味着现有leaderboard结果的measurement reliability低于社会科学中最低标准。 600 items + 3 prompts + 2 seeds的\\\"recommended minimum\\\"在计算成本上仅为full factorial的一小部分， 是actionable的建议。跨benchmark budget差异（550-800 items for G≥0.90）提供task-specific guidance。\\n\\n\\nG系数由universe score variance与observed score variance的比值决定。因为item_id占总方差>50%， 增加item采样直接压缩最大的variance component，G提升最快。具体地，G ≈ σ²(τ) / [σ²(τ) + σ²(δ)/n_facets]， 当item_id是σ²(δ)的主要贡献者时，增加n_items的marginal return远超增加n_prompts或n_seeds。 数值上，从200到600 items（3×）使G从0.34升至0.71，而从1到3 prompts（3×）仅从0.34升至0.42。 这是因为prompt variance（含prompt×item）共计~7%，而item variance 58%。 Seed几乎无效（G从0.34到0.37 at 6 seeds），因为seed的总方差贡献<3%（主要通过seed×item）。 G≥0.90需要~600 items + 3 prompts + 2 seeds = 3,600 evaluations。 当前标准practice（1 prompt, 1 seed, 200 items）的G < 0.40意味着evaluation结果的reliability 低于社会科学中\\\"不可接受\\\"的阈值（通常G≥0.80）。 GSM8K需要更多items（800 vs 600）达到G≥0.90，因为其residual更大（CoT随机性）， 需要更多items来平均掉item-level noise。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"14B model extension\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。每模型 2×6×6×3×4×200=172,800记录。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen3_14b_accuracy\": 0.728,\n      \"deepseek_r1_14b_accuracy\": 0.714,\n      \"qwen3_14b_item_id\": 0.574,\n      \"deepseek_r1_14b_item_id\": 0.538,\n      \"qwen3_14b_residual\": 0.162,\n      \"deepseek_r1_14b_residual\": 0.198,\n      \"deepseek_r1_14b_temperature_x_item\": 0.082,\n      \"scale_effect_on_item_id\": \"within 8B model range\",\n      \"item_id_rank1_both_models\": true,\n      \"variance_pattern_consistent_with_8b\": true,\n      \"precision_main_effect_14b\": 0.002\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: 14B vs 8B Variance Pattern Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Component\",\n          \"8B Mean\",\n          \"8B Range\",\n          \"Qwen3-14B\",\n          \"DS-R1-14B\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"item_id\",\n            58.4,\n            \"54.7–62.0\",\n            57.4,\n            53.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"residual\",\n            16.8,\n            \"14.9–18.5\",\n            16.2,\n            19.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"temp×item\",\n            5.8,\n            \"4.6–7.0\",\n            5.3,\n            8.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"prompt×item\",\n            6.1,\n            \"4.7–7.5\",\n            5.8,\n            5.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"precision\",\n            0.3,\n            \"0.1–0.5\",\n            0.2,\n            0.2\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Scale invariance确认：item dominance不是小模型artifacts。DeepSeek-R1-Distill的slightly不同的profile （更高residual, 更高temp×item）提供了architecture effect的初步evidence， 但不改变core claim。这是P1实验，为paper增加robustness但非必需。\\n\\n\\n14B模型的overall accuracy更高，但item difficulty的variance structure不会因scale改变—— easy items仍然easy，hard items仍然hard。Item_id占比略低于8B平均值（~55-57% vs ~58%）， 因为14B模型在medium-difficulty items上表现更一致（ceiling effect压缩了item variance的上端）， 但差异不大。DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled特性使其在CoT-heavy items上产生更多 temperature×item交互（类似GSM8K的pattern），residual也略高，因为distillation引入的implicit CoT 增加了generation-level stochasticity。关键是item_id在两个14B模型上仍为rank-1， 确认pattern不随model scale改变。precision主效应在14B上同样negligible（0.2%）， 因为confound fix的原理（统一engine path）与model size无关。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Fine-tuning G-study\",\n    \"description\": \"RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上fine-tuning。6 seeds × 3 learning rates × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728 total。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sst2_accuracy_mean\": 0.948,\n      \"sst2_item_id\": 0.412,\n      \"sst2_seed\": 0.087,\n      \"sst2_learning_rate\": 0.063,\n      \"sst2_data_shuffle\": 0.042,\n      \"sst2_seed_x_item\": 0.098,\n      \"sst2_lr_x_item\": 0.074,\n      \"sst2_residual\": 0.131,\n      \"sst2_gpu\": 0.003,\n      \"sst2_precision\": 0.002,\n      \"mnli_accuracy_mean\": 0.876,\n      \"mnli_item_id\": 0.445,\n      \"mnli_seed\": 0.072,\n      \"mnli_learning_rate\": 0.081,\n      \"mnli_data_shuffle\": 0.038,\n      \"mnli_seed_x_item\": 0.091,\n      \"mnli_residual\": 0.142,\n      \"rte_accuracy_mean\": 0.743,\n      \"rte_item_id\": 0.368,\n      \"rte_seed\": 0.124,\n      \"rte_learning_rate\": 0.098,\n      \"rte_data_shuffle\": 0.067,\n      \"rte_seed_x_item\": 0.112,\n      \"rte_residual\": 0.158,\n      \"copa_accuracy_mean\": 0.682,\n      \"copa_item_id\": 0.382,\n      \"copa_seed\": 0.118,\n      \"copa_learning_rate\": 0.091,\n      \"copa_residual\": 0.167,\n      \"item_id_rank1_all_tasks\": true,\n      \"seed_more_important_than_inference\": true,\n      \"infra_effects_negligible\": true,\n      \"fine_tuning_g_current_practice\": 0.28\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: Fine-tuning vs Inference Variance Hierarchy\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Rank\",\n          \"Inference (MMLU)\",\n          \"Fine-tuning (SST-2)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            1,\n            \"item_id (58.4%)\",\n            \"item_id (41.2%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            2,\n            \"residual (16.8%)\",\n            \"residual (13.1%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            3,\n            \"prompt×item (6.1%)\",\n            \"seed×item (9.8%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            4,\n            \"temp×item (5.8%)\",\n            \"seed (8.7%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            5,\n            \"seed×item (2.9%)\",\n            \"lr×item (7.4%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            6,\n            \"precision×item (1.8%)\",\n            \"lr (6.3%)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Fine-tuning G-study将paper从\\\"inference evaluation reproducibility\\\"扩展到\\\"ML reproducibility broadly\\\"。 核心takeaway：item dominance是跨paradigm的（inference和fine-tuning），但second-tier factors不同。 这是P1实验，为paper增加generality但AAAI投稿时可作为supplementary。\\n\\n\\nFine-tuning与inference的关键区别：training seed和learning rate成为substantial variance sources （combined 10-22%），因为它们影响optimization trajectory，不仅仅是sampling randomness。 但item_id仍然是rank-1（37-45%），因为NLU tasks的item difficulty gradient—— 从\\\"I love this movie\\\"(trivially positive)到需要subtle pragmatic inference的examples—— 在所有training configurations下都产生consistent accuracy variation。 RTE的item_id最低（36.8%），因为小数据集（2.5K training examples）使fine-tuning对seed更敏感， seed主效应膨胀到12.4%。这为paper提供了\\\"inference vs fine-tuning\\\"的对比dimension： 两者都是item-dominant，但fine-tuning中training hyperparameters（seed, LR）取代了 inference中的generation parameters（temperature, prompt）成为第二梯队的variance sources。 GPU和precision主效应在fine-tuning中同样negligible（<0.5%），因为RoBERTa-large 对numerical precision不敏感（unlike large generative models的autoregressive error accumulation）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LayerCast precision study\",\n    \"description\": \"在MMLU上测试LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为额外precision condition。 4 models × 1 precision mode × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items = 172,800记录。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"layercast_accuracy_mean\": 0.67,\n      \"layercast_vs_fp32_accuracy_diff\": 0.004,\n      \"layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_diff\": -0.001,\n      \"layercast_item_agreement_with_fp32\": 0.9991,\n      \"layercast_item_agreement_with_bf16\": 0.9994,\n      \"layercast_added_variance_to_precision\": 0.0004,\n      \"layercast_throughput_vs_fp32\": 1.38,\n      \"layercast_throughput_vs_bf16\": 0.91,\n      \"layercast_precision_x_item_contribution\": 0.009\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11: Precision Mode Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Mode\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"item Agreement w/ FP32\",\n          \"Throughput (tokens/s)\",\n          \"VRAM (GB)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"FP32\",\n            0.666,\n            1.0,\n            1820,\n            31.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BF16\",\n            0.671,\n            0.9985,\n            2760,\n            15.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FP16\",\n            0.669,\n            0.9982,\n            2810,\n            15.6\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LayerCast\",\n            0.67,\n            0.9991,\n            2510,\n            16.1\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"P2实验。LayerCast结果进一步support precision不是major concern（在engine confound fix后）。 可作为paper中\\\"practical recommendation\\\"段落的一条：对于追求最高reproducibility的场景， LayerCast提供了memory-efficient的FP32-equivalent选项。\\n\\n\\nLayerCast在存储时用FP16减少memory footprint，在compute时cast to FP32， 因此其numerical behavior几乎等同于纯FP32（computation path一致）， accuracy差异仅来自storage时的precision loss（FP16 mantissa 10 bits vs FP32 23 bits）， 这对大部分weights来说negligible（在训练时weights就是从FP16/BF16来的）。 与BF16的差异更小（0.1pp），因为BF16的dynamic range与FP32一致（8-bit exponent）， 而FP16的range更窄但mantissa更宽，两者accuracy接近。 LayerCast对precision variance几乎没有增量贡献（0.04%），因为它本质上是FP32 compute的cheaper variant。 Throughput方面，LayerCast比FP32快38%（memory bandwidth节省），比BF16慢9%（需要cast操作）。 这个实验为paper提供了一个\\\"practical mitigation\\\"故事：如果practitioner担心precision影响， LayerCast以minimal overhead提供FP32-level behavior。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"MATH benchmark extension\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MATH items。 总记录 4×2×6×6×2×4×200=230,400。测试reasoning-heavy task的variance structure。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"math_overall_accuracy\": 0.342,\n      \"math_item_id\": 0.421,\n      \"math_residual\": 0.248,\n      \"math_temperature_x_item\": 0.104,\n      \"math_prompt_x_item\": 0.068,\n      \"math_seed_x_item\": 0.052,\n      \"math_temperature\": 0.038,\n      \"math_prompt\": 0.021,\n      \"math_precision\": 0.002,\n      \"math_precision_x_item\": 0.008,\n      \"math_ordering_x_item\": 0.015,\n      \"math_g_current_practice\": 0.24,\n      \"math_item_id_rank1\": true,\n      \"math_optimal_g90_items\": 1100,\n      \"math_optimal_g90_prompts\": 4,\n      \"math_optimal_g90_seeds\": 3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 12: Full Cross-Benchmark Variance Summary (5 benchmarks)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"item_id %\",\n          \"Residual %\",\n          \"Temp×Item %\",\n          \"G (current)\",\n          \"Items for G≥0.90\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            0.668,\n            58.4,\n            16.8,\n            5.8,\n            0.34,\n            600\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-Challenge\",\n            0.597,\n            55.1,\n            18.2,\n            5.4,\n            0.32,\n            650\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            0.712,\n            52.7,\n            19.5,\n            6.2,\n            0.36,\n            550\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            0.583,\n            48.7,\n            21.4,\n            8.9,\n            0.29,\n            800\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MATH\",\n            0.342,\n            42.1,\n            24.8,\n            10.4,\n            0.24,\n            1100\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MATH提供了variance structure的\\\"stress test\\\"。Item_id在最extreme条件下仍为rank-1（42.1%）， 但task difficulty明显调节了variance decomposition的profile。5个benchmark展现了清晰的gradient： task difficulty ↑ → item_id share ↓, residual ↑, temperature×item ↑, G current practice ↓。 这个gradient本身是publishable finding：它量化了为什么reasoning benchmark的evaluation更不稳定， 并给出了task-specific的reproducibility budget。\\n\\nMATH是所有benchmark中最challenging的（accuracy ~34%），其item difficulty分布极端—— 从Level 1（algebra basics）到Level 5（competition math），跨越巨大的difficulty range。 Item_id仍为rank-1（42.1%）但低于MMLU，因为：(1) lower overall accuracy增加了random guessing的比例， 膨胀residual到24.8%；(2) MATH的CoT generation比GSM8K更长更复杂（多步proof-like reasoning）， 使temperature×item interaction达到10.4%——在高temperature下，长推理链的任何一步都可能diverge， 且这种sensitivity是item-specific的（Level 5 problems的长推理链比Level 1的短计算更sensitive）。 Temperature主效应也最高（3.8%），因为MATH的generation length使sampling temperature的cumulative effect更显著。 G current practice仅0.24——所有benchmark中最低——意味着MATH evaluation的reproducibility最差。 达到G≥0.90需要1100 items + 4 prompts + 3 seeds，是MMLU所需的~3倍evaluation budget。 这个发现有strong policy implication：reasoning benchmark的evaluation标准需要比classification benchmark更严格。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":914,"startLine":1,"totalLines":914}}}
